"hud": ["Strike the governor’s bright tooth", "Hang the winding key on the toll hook"],
"lines": ["Thirty-nine, forty. The governor at the top of the ladder turns me. Strike its bright tooth; anything else and you only bruise your arm.", "Take the key from my back, would you? Hang it on the toll hook, at the top of the next climb. Where nobody can wind me."],
